   "_id": 13261,
   "ANSWER": "<p data-end=\"8111\" data-start=\"7758\"><strong data-end=\"7771\" data-start=\"7760\">Answer Key:</strong></p>\n\n<ol data-end=\"2831\" data-start=\"2257\">\n\t<li data-end=\"2335\" data-start=\"2184\">\n\t<p data-end=\"3238\" data-start=\"3130\"><strong data-end=\"3183\" data-start=\"3146\">Multi-factor authentication (MFA)</strong> combines two or more authentication factors such as:</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"3275\" data-start=\"3239\">\n\t<p data-end=\"3275\" data-start=\"3241\"><strong data-end=\"3264\" data-start=\"3241\">Something you know:</strong> Password</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"3325\" data-start=\"3276\">\n\t<p data-end=\"3325\" data-start=\"3278\"><strong data-end=\"3301\" data-start=\"3278\">Something you have:</strong> OTP token, smart card</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"2335\" data-start=\"2184\">\n\t<p data-end=\"4624\" data-start=\"4473\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n\t<p data-end=\"3647\" data-start=\"3362\"><strong data-end=\"3377\" data-start=\"3362\">Importance:</strong><br data-end=\"3380\" data-start=\"3377\" />\n\tEnhances security by requiring multiple proofs of identity, making unauthorized access significantly harder.<br data-end=\"3491\" data-start=\"3488\" />\n\t<strong data-end=\"3503\" data-start=\"3491\">Example:</strong> Logging into a bank account requires both password (knowledge) and OTP sent to mobile (possession), reducing risks of credential theft attacks.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"3360\" data-start=\"3326\">\n\t<p data-end=\"3360\" data-start=\"3328\"><strong data-end=\"3350\" data-start=\"3328\">Something you are:</strong> Biometric</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n",
